          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import from Photos": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从相册导入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import Result": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "导入结果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Imported: %lld.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已导入 %lld 个验证码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Imported: %lld. Skipped (already added): %lld.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已导入 %1$lld 个验证码，跳过 %2$lld 个已存在的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In 2FAS, use “Settings → Backup → Export”.\n\nIf the backup is encrypted, you’ll need its password to decrypt it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 2FAS 中的「设置 → 备份 → 导出」选项。\n\n如果备份已加密，需要输入密码来解密。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Aegis settings, use “Export the vault”.\n\nIf the vault is encrypted, you’ll need the vault password to decrypt it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 Aegis 设置中的「导出密码库」选项。\n\n如果密码库已加密，需要输入密码库密码才能解密。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In andOTP settings, use “Backup” to export a backup.\n\nIf the backup is encrypted, you’ll need the backup password to decrypt it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 andOTP 设置中的「备份」选项导出备份。\n\n如果备份已加密，需要输入备份密码才能解密。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Bitwarden tools, use “Export vault”, then import the unencrypted JSON file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 Bitwarden 工具中的「导出密码库」选项，导入未加密的 JSON 文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Google Authenticator, use “Transfer accounts” to export your accounts as QR codes, then scan them or import them from images. Many accounts produce several QR codes; scan all of them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Google Authenticator 中使用「转移账号」把账号导出为二维码，然后扫描二维码或从图片导入。账号较多时会生成多张二维码，需要全部扫完。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In LastPass Authenticator settings, choose “Transfer accounts”, then “Export accounts to file”, and import the downloaded JSON.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 LastPass Authenticator 设置中的「转移账户」选项，然后点「将账户导出到文件」，导入下载的 JSON。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Proton Authenticator settings, use “Export”.\n\nIf the export is password-protected, you’ll need the password to decrypt it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 Proton Authenticator 设置中的「导出」选项导出验证码。\n\n如果导出文件设置了密码，需要输入密码才能解密。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Raivo settings, use “Export OTPs to ZIP archive”.\n\nUnzip the file and import the JSON file inside.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 Raivo 设置中的「Export OTPs to ZIP archive」选项。\n\n解压 zip 文件后导入其中的 JSON 文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
